  "releaseNotes": "v2.4.2:\n- Fixed Asterisk version auto-detection for Asterisk 13+ (16, 18, 20, 21, etc.) to correctly use comma as variable separator during Originate action.\n\nv2.4.0:\n- Fixed property shadowing in QueueMember*Event classes (properties were hiding base class members)\n- Fixed AddKeyValue to concatenate duplicate AMI keys instead of overwriting\n- Fixed thread-safety: added lock on socket write for concurrent AMI actions\n- Added events: DTMFBegin, DTMFEnd, HangupRequest, MusicOnHold, MusicOnHoldStart, MusicOnHoldStop, QueueSummary",
